/*
 * AI-CONTEXT:
 *
 * Purpose:
 * - Enterprise TypeScript configuration for Treishvaam Agro frontend.
 * - Controls module resolution, strict typing, and path aliases.
 *
 * Scope:
 * - Build-time compilation and IDE intelligence.
 * - What it must never be responsible for: Runtime logic.
 *
 * Critical Dependencies:
 * - Frontend: Next.js 14+ (Turbopack compatible).
 * - Cloudflare Pages: Requires absolute precision in module paths.
 *
 * Non-Negotiables:
 * - "baseUrl": "." MUST be present for Turbopack to resolve absolute "@/*" paths.
 * - Deprecated directories (like _pages_old) MUST be excluded to prevent build crashes.
 *
 * Change Intent:
 * - Excluding _pages_old to fix a Type Error where legacy files were attempting to import missing components (RFQForm).
 *
 * Future AI Guidance:
 * - Do not remove the baseUrl directive; it will instantly break Cloudflare OpenNext builds.
 * - Do not remove _pages_old from the exclude array unless the legacy code is fixed and restored.
 *
 * IMMUTABLE CHANGE HISTORY (DO NOT DELETE):
 * - ADDED:
 * • "baseUrl": "." to compilerOptions.
 * • Why it was added: Turbopack failed with 14 errors unable to resolve '@/components/...'.
 * • 2026-04-09
 *
 * - EDITED:
 * • Added "_pages_old" to the exclude array.
 * • Why the edit was required: The Next.js build crashed during the Type Checking phase because legacy files were referencing deleted components.
 * • 2026-04-10
 *
 * - DO-NOT-DELETE RULE:
 * This IMMUTABLE CHANGE HISTORY section must never be deleted,
 * truncated, rewritten, or regenerated.
 * Future AI must append only.
 */
{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "baseUrl": ".",
    "lib": ["dom", "dom.iterable", "esnext"],
    "allowJs": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "strict": true,
    "noEmit": true,
    "esModuleInterop": true,
    "module": "esnext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "resolveJsonModule": true,
    "isolatedModules": true,
    "jsx": "preserve",
    "incremental": true,
    "plugins": [
      {
        "name": "next"
      }
    ],
    "paths": {
      "@/*": ["./*"]
    }
  },
  "include": ["next-env.d.ts", "**/*.ts", "**/*.tsx", ".next/types/**/*.ts", "tailwind.config.js"],
  "exclude": ["node_modules", "_pages_old"]
}